---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<Base title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.company}`} description="How New Block handles information submitted through its accessibility review landing page.">
  <main class="wrap legal" id="top">
    <a href="/">← Back to the accessibility page</a>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Updated November 9, 2026</p>
    <p>{site.company} collects the information you choose to provide when you ask about an on-site or website accessibility review, including through our inquiry forms on this site and our Facebook Instant Form for a free website accessibility audit. This may include your first and last name, phone number, email address, practice or business name, role, ZIP code, website address, and details about your inquiry. Our site and service providers may also collect page, referral, campaign, and basic technical information.</p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>We use this information to respond to your request, discuss or arrange a review or audit, keep a record of the inquiry, and understand how people find this page. If you separately choose to receive texts, we may send non-marketing messages about your inquiry and scheduling. You can withdraw that permission by replying STOP.</p>

    <h2>SMS opt-in</h2>
    <p>We collect text consent in two places, and in both it is optional:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Website inquiry forms.</strong> Each form has a separate SMS consent checkbox that is unchecked by default.</li>
      <li><strong>Facebook Instant Form.</strong> Our form titled “Dental Practice | Free Website Audit | SMS Choice | Nov 2026” on the New Block Facebook Page asks an optional question with two answers: “Yes, I agree to receive texts” and “No, email only.” Neither answer is preselected.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you check the website box or choose “Yes, I agree to receive texts,” you agree to receive texts from {site.company} at +1 (949) 569-6374 limited to acknowledging your inquiry, coordinating your accessibility audit, and scheduling that you request. We do not send promotional offers by text. If you choose “No, email only,” leave the question blank, or leave the box unchecked, we will not text you. Message frequency varies; message and data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help or STOP to opt out. We record your text preference with your inquiry. Consent to texts is not a condition of purchase or of requesting a review or free audit.</p>

    <h2>Who helps us process information</h2>
    <p>We use service providers for website hosting, customer relationship management, analytics, and communications. They process information to provide those services to us. No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. We do not sell or share SMS opt-in data or consent with any third party, except service providers that are strictly necessary to deliver the text messages you requested. Those providers may not use that information for their own marketing or any other independent purpose.</p>

    <h2>Data security</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable steps to protect the information submitted through this site and limit access to people and service providers who need it to handle your inquiry. No method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>This site and its service providers may use cookies and similar tracking technology to understand visits, measure advertising referrals, and connect an inquiry with its source. You can manage cookies through your browser settings. Disabling them may affect some site features or attribution.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Text consent is optional. You may ask us to access, correct, or delete information you submitted by contacting us. We keep information for as long as reasonably needed to handle inquiries, run our business, and meet applicable obligations.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>{site.company}<br />{site.address}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br /><a href={`tel:${site.phoneE164}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    <p>See our <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and our <a href="/sms-consent/">SMS consent documentation</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal{max-width:760px;padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:80px}
  .legal h1{margin:24px 0 10px}
  .legal h2{font-size:1.4rem;margin:34px 0 8px}
  .legal p{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px}
  .legal a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline}
  .legal ul{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;padding-left:22px}
  .legal li{margin:0 0 8px}
</style>
